# Model artifacts are build output, not source. Rebuild with:
#   python -m ml.train --dataset <csv> --out artifacts
# Ship them via your release pipeline or an object store, not git -- committing
# binaries is how this project ended up with five .pkl files totalling 349 MB.
artifacts/*.joblib
!artifacts/model_meta.json
